  "question": {
    "zh_cn": "如何让口型、面部表情与场景氛围在不同尺度上共同约束配音韵律？",
    "en": "How can lip motion, facial affect, and scene context jointly constrain dubbing prosody at different visual scales?"
  },
  "contribution": {
    "zh_cn": "以口型、面部和场景三层视觉线索分别建模时长、局部音高/能量与全局情感条件。",
    "en": "It models duration, local pitch/energy, and global emotional conditioning from lip, face, and scene cues respectively."
  },
